# Docker build context excludes (context = repository root, docs/Dockerfile).
# The docs image only needs: root workspace files, docs/, and the package.json
# of every workspace member (pnpm-lock.yaml importers must all resolve) — so
# sibling packages are kept but their heavy outputs are not.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/release
**/coverage
src
tests
docs/shots
npm/*/bin
npm/*/app
